 "docs": {
  "en": {
   "title": "Where is there snow in Finland right now? North of Oulu, thinly (13 November 2026)",
   "description": "Measured snow depth in Finland on 13 November 2026: 58 of 161 stations white, almost all of them north of the 64th parallel, the deepest only 13 cm at Kilpisjärvi. The south, Helsinki and Tampere included, is bare.",
   "lede": "Finland has a clear snow line this Friday, and it runs roughly through Oulu. North of it, nearly every weather station measured snow on the ground; south of it, almost none did. But even in the white half the cover is thin: nowhere in the country did a station measure more than 13 cm.",
   "sections": [
    {
     "h": "North of Oulu: white, a few centimetres",
     "p": [
      "Between the 64th and 66th parallels, 23 of 25 stations have snow, and between the 66th and 68th, 15 of 19. Typical depths are 5 to 9 cm: Kemijärvi 9 cm, Kuusamo, Siikajoki and Apukka in Rovaniemi 8 cm, Oulu and Rovaniemi airport 7 cm, Salla and Savukoski 6 cm.",
      "Much of it is new. Oulu and Siikajoki had bare ground on Thursday; the overnight snowfall along the Bothnian Bay coast turned them white in one go."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "The far north: thinner than you would think",
     "p": [
      "Lapland's top is not leading this year. Kilpisjärvi, in the fell country of the north-west arm, has the most in Finland with 13 cm. Saariselkä has 4 cm, Lokka 2 cm, and Nuorgam and Kevo in Utsjoki 2 cm each. North of the 68th parallel, 8 of 14 stations still measured bare ground."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "The south: bare",
     "p": [
      "Between the 60th and 62nd parallels only 6 of 53 stations have any snow at all, and none more than 2 cm. Helsinki measured 0 cm at all five of its stations, and the stations around Tampere are bare too. In our snow history Helsinki usually gets its first lasting snow around 20 November, so the south is not behind yet."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "The weekend",
     "p": [
      "The north gets a little more: about 5 cm in Rovaniemi over Saturday and Sunday, and 1 to 2 cm in Oulu, with nights between -8 °C and -12 °C in Lapland. The south stays grey and mild, up to about 8 °C in Helsinki on Sunday, with rain on Monday."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "advice": [
    "For snow this weekend, head north of Oulu: Kuusamo, the Rovaniemi area and Kemijärvi are white.",
    "Thin early snow hides open water: rivers, lakes and bogs are not frozen yet.",
    "Winter tyres for any trip north: Oulu's roads got fresh snow overnight."
   ],
   "captions": {
    "snow": "Snow depth measured at the weather stations on 13 November 2026: each dot is a station, coloured by its depth (light blue = a few cm, dark blue = deep); white dots with a grey ring = bare ground. Labels give the depth at the main stations. Measurements only, no model layer."
   },
   "method": "Snow depth today: measured at weather stations on the morning of 13 November 2026 (Finnish Meteorological Institute); a station reports the snow on its own small plot, so a few kilometres away and a hundred metres higher the ground can look different. Usual depth for the date: SnowScope snow history, 46 past winters (1980-81 to 2025-26), a model of the past at the city's height, not a station record. Weekend: two weather models (ECMWF IFS and DWD ICON, read through Open-Meteo), given as a range. Places and rules: the official pages listed below.",
   "references": [
    {
     "text": "Finnish Meteorological Institute, open data (daily snow depth)",
     "url": "https://en.ilmatieteenlaitos.fi/open-data"
    },
    {
     "text": "Open-Meteo, weather forecast data (ECMWF and ICON models)",
     "url": "https://open-meteo.com/"
    }
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Snow map on SnowScope",
     "url": "https://snowscope.app/"
    }
   ]
  },
  "sv": {
   "title": "Var finns det snö i Finland just nu? Norr om Uleåborg, tunt (13 november 2026)",
   "description": "Uppmätt snödjup i Finland den 13 november 2026: 58 av 161 stationer vita, nästan alla norr om 64:e breddgraden, den djupaste bara 13 cm i Kilpisjärvi. Söder, Helsingfors och Tammerfors inräknade, är bar.",
   "lede": "Finland har en tydlig snögräns den här fredagen, och den går ungefär genom Uleåborg. Norr om den mätte nästan varje väderstation snö på marken; söder om den nästan ingen. Men även i den vita halvan är täcket tunt: ingen station i landet mätte mer än 13 cm.",
   "sections": [
    {
     "h": "Norr om Uleåborg: vitt, några centimeter",
     "p": [
      "Mellan 64:e och 66:e breddgraden har 23 av 25 stationer snö, och mellan 66:e och 68:e 15 av 19. Typiska djup är 5 till 9 cm: Kemijärvi 9 cm, Kuusamo, Siikajoki och Apukka i Rovaniemi 8 cm, Uleåborg och Rovaniemi flygplats 7 cm, Salla och Savukoski 6 cm.",
      "Mycket av det är nytt. Uleåborg och Siikajoki hade barmark i torsdags; nattens snöfall längs Bottenvikskusten gjorde dem vita på en gång."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "Längst i norr: tunnare än man tror",
     "p": [
      "Lapplands topp leder inte i år. Kilpisjärvi, i fjällen i nordvästra armen, har mest i Finland med 13 cm. Saariselkä har 4 cm, Lokka 2 cm, och Nuorgam och Kevo i Utsjoki 2 cm vardera. Norr om 68:e breddgraden mätte 8 av 14 stationer fortfarande barmark."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "Söder: bart",
     "p": [
      "Mellan 60:e och 62:a breddgraden har bara 6 av 53 stationer någon snö alls, och ingen mer än 2 cm. Helsingfors mätte 0 cm vid alla sina fem stationer, och stationerna runt Tammerfors är också bara. I vår snöhistorik får Helsingfors normalt sin första bestående snö runt 20 november, så söder ligger inte efter än."
     ]
    },
    {
     "h": "Helgen",
     "p": [
      "Norr får lite till: runt 5 cm i Rovaniemi under lördag och söndag, och 1 till 2 cm i Uleåborg, med nätter mellan -8 °C och -12 °C i Lappland. Söder förblir grått och milt, upp mot 8 °C i Helsingfors på söndag, med regn på måndag."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "advice": [
    "För snö i helgen: åk norr om Uleåborg; Kuusamo, Rovaniemitrakten och Kemijärvi är vita.",
    "Tunn tidig snö döljer öppet vatten: älvar, sjöar och myrar är inte frusna än.",
    "Vinterdäck för alla resor norrut: Uleåborgs vägar fick nysnö i natt."
